{"ts":"2026-08-20T21:39:21.406Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"0c521f6b9de253ca0feab1e1","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-c90tfh","claim:pm-jhpby4","claim:pm-ob9z4y","lineage:pm-jhpby4","lineage:pm-m2u1","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-c90tfh+pm-jhpby4+pm-ob9z4y","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-c90tfh","claim:pm-jhpby4","claim:pm-ob9z4y","lineage:pm-jhpby4","lineage:pm-m2u1","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Context\nThe historical blocking assertion counted all blocks rows identically and carried a total ceiling of 243. Accepted graph reconstruction also requires evidence-backed ordering edges, so one undifferentiated ratchet could not express all required properties.\n\n## Decision\nRetain the historical total ceiling of 243 as a blocking outer bound. Define evidence-cited blocks by the explicit evidence: source-kind prefix. Define uncited blocks as total minus evidence-cited. Move the anti-fabrication ratchet to the uncited population at its current ceiling of 202 and add a floor of 3 over evidence-cited rows. All three assertions remain blocking and carry adjacent pass/fail negative controls.\n\n## Consequences\nTotal ordering edges cannot grow beyond the historical bound without a new Decision. Adding an evidence-cited ordering edge cannot spend anti-fabrication headroom. Deleting recovered ordering fails the evidence floor. Adding a block without evidence provenance fails the uncited ceiling. Changing any population requires a verified Decision."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-20T21:39:21.406Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"in_progress"}],"before_hash":"551d549aef3e40973050a289a1d7bd4c7c8f0d40b031eea6ce8cd207bd6c4dd7","after_hash":"ea626383d57f2df5c8b9c99aabb0d7e2411238ff36a0fe908d949281c1e964ee","item_hash_version":2,"message":"Align the ADR body with the authorized three-ratchet model"}
